        rdfs:comment        "Anon., \"On Oriental Carpets. Article 1.-Introduction\", <i>The Burlington Magazine</i>, 1/1 (March 1903) pp.77-78 colour plates.\nEdouard Lièvre, <i>Musée graphique pour l'étude de l'art dans toutes des applications</i>, IV (Paris: 1880-3) pl.81. \nAna Raquel Santos, <i>The Discovery of three lost 'Salting' carpets: Science as a tool for revealing their history</i>, Master thesis in Conservation and Restoration, Universidade Nova de Lisboa (Lisbon 2010).\nJohn Mills, \"The Salting Group: A History and a Clarification\", in Murray L. Eiland and Robert Pinner (eds.), <i>The Salting Carpets</i>, <i>Oriental Carpet and Textile Studies</i> 5/2 (1999) 1-17.\nJennifer Wearden, \"The Riddle of the Salting Carpet\", <i>Oriental Art</i> 43/1 (1997) 21-27."@en ;
